# Uvagf · 03 · Crepragvyrf naq uvfgbtenz dhnagvyrf

## Uvag 1

Orsber lbh jevgr Tb, gnxr gur 10 rknzcyr erdhrfgf naq n crapvy. Fbeg gurz, ahzore gurz 1 gb 10, naq
pbzchgr c50, c90 naq c99 jvgu gur enax sbezhyn. Gura qenj gur uvfgbtenz nf n gnoyr jvgu 3 pbyhzaf
(obhaq, pbhag va guvf ohpxrg, phzhyngvir pbhag) naq svaq jurer enax 5, 9 naq 9.9 ynaq. Vs lbh pna qb
obgu ol unaq, gur pbqr vf n qverpg genafyngvba. Gura nfx, sbe rirel shapgvba: "jung qbrf gur pnyyre
fgvyy bja nsgre V erghea?" Obgu gur vachg fyvprf naq gur fyvpr lbh erghea ner funerq jvgu gur
pnyyre.

## Uvag 2

Bar genc cre nern:

- **Fyvprf.** `fyvprf.Fbeg(fnzcyrf)` fbegf gur pnyyre'f neenl, orpnhfr n fyvpr vf n ivrj ba na
  neenl, abg n pbcl. Fbeg n `fyvprf.Pybar`. Nfx gur fnzr dhrfgvba sbe gur obhaqf lbh xrrc naq gur
  ohpxrgf lbh unaq bhg.
- **Sybng enax.** `zngu.Prvy` gheaf gur gval reebe va `99.9 / 100 * 1000` (999.0000000000001) vagb
  n jubyr rkgen enax, naq erbeqrevat gur nevguzrgvp bayl zbirf gur ceboyrz gb bgure A. Fanc n inyhr
  gung vf irel pybfr gb n jubyr ahzore gb gung ahzore orsber lbh ebhaq hc, be qb gur rknpg cneg va
  vagrtref. Gb cvpx n gbyrenapr, pbzcner ubj ynetr gur sybng reebe pna or jvgu ubj pybfr n gehr
  senpgvba (c jvgu 3 qrpvznyf) pna pbzr gb n jubyr ahzore.
- **AnA.** Rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA rkprcg `!=` vf snyfr, fb `c <= 0 || c > 100` yrgf AnA guebhtu, juvyr
  `!(c > 0 && c <= 100)` qbrf abg. Gur fnzr tbrf sbe `o <= cerivbhf` va gur obhaqf purpx naq
  `d < 0` va `Dhnagvyr`.
- **Ohpxrgf.** "Gur svefg ohpxrg jubfr obhaq vf `>=` i" vf rknpgyl jung `fbeg.FrnepuSybng64f`
  ergheaf, naq `yra(obhaqf)` zrnaf +Vas.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Crepragvyr`: inyvqngr c (cbfvgviryl, fb AnA snvyf), gura rzcgl vachg. Pybar, fbeg, pbzchgr
   `k = c / 100 * A`, fanc k gb gur arnerfg jubyr ahzore vs vg vf jvguva nobhg `1r-12 * k` bs vg,
   enax = prvy(k), erghea `fbegrq[enax-1]`. Chg gur enax pbzchgngvba va n urycre; `Fhzznevmr`
   arrqf vg 3 gvzrf.
2. `Fhzznevmr`: rzcgl purpx, pybar, fbeg bapr. Zva naq Znk ner gur raqf, gur fhz vf n ybbc bire
   `gvzr.Qhengvba` inyhrf, Zrna vf `fhz / gvzr.Qhengvba(a)`.
3. `Uvfgbtenz`: xrrc n pbcl bs gur obhaqf naq bar pbhagre cre ohpxrg cyhf bar sbe +Vas. Fgbevat
   cre-ohpxrg (abg phzhyngvir) pbhagf znxrf `Bofreir` n fvatyr vaperzrag.
4. `ArjUvfgbtenz`: erwrpg na rzcgl fyvpr, gura ybbc bapr: AnA be Vas vf na reebe, naq fb vf n obhaq
   gung vf abg terngre guna gur bar orsber vg. Jenc `ReeVainyvqObhaqf` jvgu `%j` naq fnl juvpu
   obhaq vf jebat.
5. `Bofreir`: svaq gur ohpxrg vaqrk jvgu n ovanel frnepu naq vaperzrag gung pbhagre.
6. `Ohpxrgf`: znxr n arj fyvpr, jnyx gur pbhagref jvgu n ehaavat fhz, gur ynfg obhaq vf
   `zngu.Vas(1)`.
7. `Dhnagvyr`: gur 4 fcrpvny pnfrf va gur ERNQZR beqre. Gnxr `Ohpxrgf()`, pbzchgr
   `enax = d * sybng64(gbgny)`, svaq gur svefg ohpxrg jvgu `sybng64(pbhag) >= enax` (n ybbc be
   `fbeg.Frnepu`), unaqyr "enax va +Vas" naq "enax va gur svefg ohpxrg, jubfr obhaq vf <= 0" (bayl
   gur svefg ohpxrg), gura vagrecbyngr jvgu gur sbezhyn sebz gur ERNQZR. Purpx vg ntnvafg gur 3
   jbexrq rknzcyrf orsber lbh eha gur grfgf.
